    {
      "sectionTitle": "Welcome to Dataiku LLM Cost Guard",
      "sectionText": "Several sections will help you configure the project to your data. You can check the requirements [here](article:15).",
      "tiles": []
    },
    {
      "sectionTitle": "Configure logs ingestion",
      "sectionText": "**To use demo logs**, select *Demo logs* and select *dataiku-managed-storage* connection. It lets you explore the features of the solution. \n**To use cloud instance logs**, select *Cloud logs* and select *dku-audit-log* connection as explained [here](https://doc.dataiku.com/dss/latest/operations/audit-trail/dataikucloud.html#access-instances-audit-logs).\n**To use event server logs**, select *Event Server logs* and select the connection to the location of your [Event Server logs](https://doc.dataiku.com/dss/latest/operations/audit-trail/eventserver.html).\n\nOnce the logs origin and connection is selected, click on **RECONFIGURE**.\n\n**For production setup** requiring regular refresh, it is strongly recommended to activate and configure the partitioning section. The smaller the partition period is, the faster and more responsive your monitoring experience will be.",
      "tiles": [
        {
          "behavior": "INLINE_AUTO_SAVE",
          "params": [
            {
              "name": "logs_origin",
              "type": "SELECT",
              "label": "Select their origin",
              "defaultValue": "demo",
              "mandatory": true,
              "canSelectForeign": false,
              "markCreatedAsBuilt": false,
              "allowDuplicates": true,
              "selectChoices": [
                {
                  "value": "demo",
                  "label": "Demo logs",
                  "showInColumnPreview": false,
                  "selected": false
                },
                {
                  "value": "cloud",
                  "label": "Cloud logs",
